Subject: [PATCH 04/37] Add Button, List and NavigationStack for Linux

Button was an empty stub. The three are the smallest versions that run the
Iris sample: Button taps its label, List stacks its rows, NavigationStack shows
one page under a back button and the title from navigationTitle.
